-  /-- **Lemma 2.1**: if `N` satisfies all requirements then so does `[N, N]`.  For the Fox
-  requirements this is proved in `FoxCommutator.lean`
-  (`FiniteChains.foxSat_commutator_forall`), assuming only that `N/[N, N]` is torsion
