-/-- **The combinatorial fundamental group** (edge-path group) of a square complex: closed walks
-based at `x`, up to homotopy through walks. -/
-def Pi1 (S : SquareComplex Vx) (x : Vx) : Type u := Quotient (walkSetoid S x x)
